  "overview": "<p>All-Star Music is a Value resort themed to music, with giant instruments and jukeboxes around the courtyards. It's the All-Star resort with Family Suites, which makes it popular with bigger families.</p><figure class=\"post-photo\"><div class=\"photo-pair\"><img src=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-rock-inn-1600.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-rock-inn-800.jpg 800w, /images/resorts/all-star-music-rock-inn-1600.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 560px) 100vw, (max-width: 820px) 50vw, 350px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A three-story Rock Inn building with a pink and black checkerboard roof and music notes along the blue and pink railings\"><img src=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-jazz-inn-1600.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-jazz-inn-800.jpg 800w, /images/resorts/all-star-music-jazz-inn-1600.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 560px) 100vw, (max-width: 820px) 50vw, 350px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A Jazz Inn building topped by a giant trumpet and saxophone, with blue Adirondack chairs on the lawn\"></div><figcaption>The resort is split into music-themed sections. Rock Inn (left) has checkerboard roofs and music-note railings, and Jazz Inn (right) has giant horns on the roof.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"post-photo\"><img src=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-pink-guitar-1600.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-pink-guitar-800.jpg 800w, /images/resorts/all-star-music-pink-guitar-1600.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 820px) 100vw, 700px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A giant pink electric guitar standing on the lawn outside a Rock Inn building\"><figcaption>Oversized instruments are everywhere, like this pink guitar outside Rock Inn.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"post-photo\"><div class=\"photo-pair\"><img src=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-guitars-1600.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-guitars-800.jpg 800w, /images/resorts/all-star-music-guitars-1600.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 560px) 100vw, (max-width: 820px) 50vw, 350px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Two giant electric guitars and tall microphone-shaped lamps on the lawn in front of Rock Inn\"><img src=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-speakers-1600.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-speakers-800.jpg 800w, /images/resorts/all-star-music-speakers-1600.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 560px) 100vw, (max-width: 820px) 50vw, 350px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A walkway between two blue buildings shaped like giant speakers\"></div><figcaption>More of Rock Inn: guitars and microphone lamps along the lawn, and stairwells built to look like giant speakers.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"post-photo\"><div class=\"photo-pair\"><img src=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-speakers-wide-1600.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-speakers-wide-800.jpg 800w, /images/resorts/all-star-music-speakers-wide-1600.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 560px) 100vw, (max-width: 820px) 50vw, 350px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Two blue speaker-shaped buildings framing a Rock Inn courtyard with giant guitars and a jukebox\"><img src=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-fountain-walk-1600.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-fountain-walk-800.jpg 800w, /images/resorts/all-star-music-fountain-walk-1600.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 560px) 100vw, (max-width: 820px) 50vw, 350px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A wide walkway lined with magnolia trees leading to a fountain\"></div><figcaption>The Rock Inn courtyard between two speaker buildings, and the tree-lined walk to the fountain.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"post-photo\"><div class=\"photo-pair\"><img src=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-jazz-inn-arch-1600.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-jazz-inn-arch-800.jpg 600w, /images/resorts/all-star-music-jazz-inn-arch-1600.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 560px) 100vw, (max-width: 820px) 50vw, 350px\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1600\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The Jazz Inn sign arching over a path, with a giant drum kit on the building behind it\"><img src=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-fountain-1600.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-fountain-800.jpg 600w, /images/resorts/all-star-music-fountain-1600.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 560px) 100vw, (max-width: 820px) 50vw, 350px\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1600\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A tiered stone fountain in front of a building with a giant trumpet on the roof\"></div><figcaption>The Jazz Inn entrance and its fountain.</figcaption></figure>",
  "suits": "<p>Families on a budget, especially groups of five or six who want a Family Suite instead of two rooms.</p>",
  "rooms": "<p>Standard rooms are compact and sleep up to four, with two queen beds or one queen plus a pull-down bed in refreshed rooms. Check the latest room setup when you book.</p><p><strong>Family Suites</strong> sleep up to six, with a separate bedroom, two bathrooms and a kitchenette.</p>",
  "pools": "<p>The guitar-shaped <strong>Calypso Pool</strong> is the main pool, and the <strong>Piano Pool</strong> is the quieter second option.</p><figure class=\"post-photo\"><img src=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-star-pool-1600.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-star-pool-800.jpg 800w, /images/resorts/all-star-music-star-pool-1600.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 820px) 100vw, 700px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A wide pool deck with red umbrellas and a large silver star on a red and white building behind the water\"><figcaption>A big silver star looks out over the pool deck.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"post-photo\"><div class=\"photo-pair\"><img src=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-calypso-maracas-1600.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-calypso-maracas-800.jpg 800w, /images/resorts/all-star-music-calypso-maracas-1600.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 560px) 100vw, (max-width: 820px) 50vw, 350px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Two giant yellow maracas next to a green Calypso building with red umbrellas below\"><img src=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-calypso-pool-1600.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-calypso-pool-800.jpg 800w, /images/resorts/all-star-music-calypso-pool-1600.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 560px) 100vw, (max-width: 820px) 50vw, 350px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The pool in front of the colorful Calypso building, with its name across the front\"></div><figcaption>The Calypso section, with its giant maracas, sits right on the pool.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"post-photo\"><img src=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-mermaid-pool-1600.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-mermaid-pool-800.jpg 800w, /images/resorts/all-star-music-mermaid-pool-1600.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 820px) 100vw, 700px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A statue of a red-haired mermaid on a rock beside a pool lined with white lounge chairs\"><figcaption>A Little Mermaid statue keeps watch by the pool.</figcaption></figure><p>For younger kids, the fenced <strong>Music Playground</strong> is for ages 2 to 12, with slides and a small climbing structure.</p><figure class=\"post-photo\"><div class=\"photo-pair\"><img src=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-playground-1600.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-playground-800.jpg 800w, /images/resorts/all-star-music-playground-1600.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 560px) 100vw, (max-width: 820px) 50vw, 350px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A small fenced playground with slides and a climbing structure, and a Music Playground sign for ages 2 to 12\"><img src=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-calypso-building-1600.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-calypso-building-800.jpg 800w, /images/resorts/all-star-music-calypso-building-1600.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 560px) 100vw, (max-width: 820px) 50vw, 350px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A bright green Calypso building with parrots and music notes on its orange railings\"></div><figcaption>The Music Playground (left), and a Calypso building with parrots and music notes on its railings (right).</figcaption></figure><p>When the kids need a break from the sun, the <strong>Note'able Games</strong> arcade is just off the main building, with racing games and ticket games.</p><figure class=\"post-photo\"><div class=\"photo-pair\"><img src=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-arcade-sign-1600.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-arcade-sign-800.jpg 600w, /images/resorts/all-star-music-arcade-sign-1600.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 560px) 100vw, (max-width: 820px) 50vw, 350px\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1600\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The Note&#x27;able Games sign, shaped like music notes, on a bright red wall\"><img src=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-arcade-1600.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-arcade-800.jpg 600w, /images/resorts/all-star-music-arcade-1600.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 560px) 100vw, (max-width: 820px) 50vw, 350px\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1600\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A row of motorcycle and truck racing arcade games on a teal patterned carpet\"></div><figcaption>Note'able Games, the resort's arcade.</figcaption></figure>",
  "dining": "<p>Dining is the <strong>Intermission Food Court</strong> plus a pool bar. There's no table-service restaurant on site.</p><figure class=\"post-photo\"><div class=\"photo-pair\"><img src=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-food-court-1600.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-food-court-800.jpg 800w, /images/resorts/all-star-music-food-court-1600.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 560px) 100vw, (max-width: 820px) 50vw, 350px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The Intermission Food Court sign under a skylight, with red music notes painted on the wall above\"><img src=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-food-court-inside-1600.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/resorts/all-star-music-food-court-inside-800.jpg 800w, /images/resorts/all-star-music-food-court-inside-1600.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 560px) 100vw, (max-width: 820px) 50vw, 350px\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Inside the food court: a long curved counter with menu screens, a coffee bar and a market area\"></div><figcaption>Intermission Food Court, with a coffee bar and grab-and-go market inside.</figcaption></figure>",
